Of course, we had to wear the-- [PAUSES FOR 3 SECONDS] either the-- the-- the Jewish armband with a Magen David, white armband with blue Magen David. Later on, they changed it to a yellow star which had to be sewn on the-- on the garment, with the name Jude printed on it. And we are not allowed to leave-- only on special assignments, which we had to get a special permission.

