He says, look-- you see what-- how-- how I look, now? You know, what-- what happened to me. He had his hair shaved.

I didn't mention this, before, that, of-- of course, all of us had shaved hair. We had to shave the hair, when we came in, and then we had to kept-- keep shaving him while we were-- you know, from time to time.

